// ────────────── Monitors ──────────────
// Intentionally empty: Niri auto-detects outputs with sane defaults.
// install.sh never overwrites this file once it exists.
//
// To set resolution, refresh rate, scale, rotation and position, either:
//   • run `nwg-displays` (a GUI that rewrites this file for you), or
//   • add blocks by hand. List your output names with `niri msg outputs`:
//
//   output "<name from niri msg outputs>" {
//       mode "2560x1440@144.000"
//       scale 1.0
//       position x=0 y=0
//   }
